lu_01Qwhr6dPKq8aF9AHTiSWrQ1", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56683, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Qwhr6dPKq8aF9AHTiSWrQ1", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 58440, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MmxEnPdjWJbYr6iKbYCYzj", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 58740, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MmxEnPdjWJbYr6iKbYCYzj", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 58740, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MmxEnPdjWJbYr6iKbYCYzj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63831, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a known-good version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again and it finished everywhere.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 and healthy. The error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) is open, and opening it pages the on-call engineer. The request timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. The incident had already been created, so I didn't submit it twice, and on-call was paged only once. It covers what failed, the rollback (including the halted first attempt), the current state and next steps.\n\n**Next steps (also in the incident):**\n- Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying. The v2.3.1-rc build was also unhealthy.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015DecxRZT1dhhsWPRi7mzDb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017KrbRiCzJtbQzDPUHrARoi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01CHkETcHTPLAvZNeUwznWzG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018kwKTBEPPo4Nv42pRwDuTK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DanjTv8hKmcZwjMfve9ACA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0189ajatdnn88XH5GfN3bW6v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu