t:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) is open, and opening it pages the on-call engineer. The request timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. The incident had already been created, so I didn't submit it twice, and on-call was paged only once. It covers what failed, the rollback (including the halted first attempt), the current state and next steps.\n\n**Next steps (also in the incident):**\n- Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying. The v2.3.1-rc build was also unhealthy.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}